---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="客户端小白教程 - 机场节点怎么用？手把手图文指南"
	description="机场节点怎么用？老叶手把手教你配置 Clash Verge、Shadowrocket(小火箭)、v2rayNG 等主流客户端，更有零成本搞定美区 Apple ID 的独家干货。"
>
	<main class="flex-1 bg-slate-50 pb-24">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-16">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
					客户端小白教程
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
					买完机场不会用？别慌，老叶手把手教你。从 Windows 到 iPhone，三分钟搞定配置，告别网络卡顿。
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Section -->
		<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
			<div class="grid gap-6">
				
				<!-- Shadowrocket Card -->
				<a href="/tutorials/shadowrocket" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-emerald-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
					<div class="h-24 w-24 flex-shrink-0 bg-blue-50 text-blue-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
						<svg class="w-12 h-12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-blue-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-blue-700">iOS / iPhone</span>
							<span class="rounded bg-rose-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-rose-700">流量密码</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Shadowrocket (小火箭) 终极指南</h2>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-2">
							手把手教你零成本搞定美区 Apple ID，下载正版小火箭，以及如何一键导入机场订阅，小白也能三分钟起飞。
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50 p-3 rounded-full group-hover:bg-emerald-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
						<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Clash Verge Card -->
				<a href="/tutorials/clash" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-emerald-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
					<div class="h-24 w-24 flex-shrink-0 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
						<svg class="w-12 h-12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-indigo-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">Windows / Mac</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Clash Verge 使用教程</h2>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-2">
							Clash for Windows 跑路后的最佳替代品。电脑端怎么配置才不会影响国内网站速度？老叶教你正确使用“规则分流”。
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50 p-3 rounded-full group-hover:bg-emerald-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
						<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- v2rayNG Card -->
				<a href="/tutorials/v2rayng" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-emerald-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
					<div class="h-24 w-24 flex-shrink-0 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
						<svg class="w-12 h-12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
							<span class="rounded bg-emerald-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700">Android / 安卓</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">v2rayNG 极简教程</h2>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-2">
							安卓阵营最稳的客户端。长得丑但是贵在不折腾，导入订阅就能用，适合不想学分流规则的纯懒人。
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50 p-3 rounded-full group-hover:bg-emerald-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
						<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
					</div>
				</a>

			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
